    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Two Italian technicians working for Rheinmetall were killed, and two other people were injured, in a drone strike against a location in Kuwait.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-26:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Iran has been blamed for the attack, but it denies responsibility.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-26:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "On 28 February 2026, during the wider 2026 Iran war, Iran began launching a series of retaliatory strikes on American and Kuwaiti targets within Kuwait, although Kuwait had maintained formal neutrality at the outset.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1388164524:0",
        "wiki:rev:1388164524:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The map shows Italy, the home country the reports place the two killed technicians in.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-26:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "As Wikipedia records them from its sources, side one lost 4 IRGC soldiers, who were captured, while on the other side 8 civilians were killed and 108 injured.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:box:1388164524:casualties-side-1-",
        "wiki:box:1388164524:casualties"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:44Z",
      "text": "The account is reported by BBC News.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-26:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:52Z",
      "text": "DW headlined the story, “Iranian drone attack kills 2 Italians in Kuwait.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:dw:bbfa2913cfd0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:00:58Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined it, “Two Italians killed by ‘drone strike debris’ in Kuwait.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:56909d1daf57"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-26T00:01:04Z",
      "text": "BBC News headlined it, “Two Italians killed in strike in Kuwait, as Iran denies responsibility.”",
      "cites": [
        "news:bbc:9cf58e9b5260"
      ]
